id: pm-puf5rq
title: "GH-1291: Windows nightly release cleanup fixture includes Node compile cache"
description: "Scheduled Nightly Validation run 35841395212 on main bd8942329b8aebbc7482ce6536135535968c0e1d failed only on Windows Node 24. The release-workspace-cleanup integration test expected its TEMP/TMP root to contain only an unrelated sentinel after installer refusal, but a Node module compile cache directory appeared there. Identify whether the directory belongs to release cleanup or test-runtime cache and preserve the meaningful owned-workspace assertion."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[5]: ci,gh-1291,nightly,temp-cleanup,windows
created_at: "2026-09-23T18:24:56.022Z"
